	(text "U10 SSD1963QL9 drives the 7\" 800x480 panel (24-bit RGB, 33.3 MHz PCLK) from a 1215 KB frame buffer; the ESP32 writes it over an\n8-bit 8080 bus (D0-D7, WR#, D/C#, CS#, RESET#). CONF=1 -> 8080 mode. RD# pulled up (no reads). CLK tied to GND, 10 MHz crystal on XTAL.\nR110-R121 33 ohm series terminations: PLACE AT THE ESP32 END of each line, bus length < 80 mm over a solid ground plane.\nD8-D23, TE, GPIO0-3, GAMAS left open as the datasheet requires. VDDD/VDDPLL = 1.2 V, VDDIO/VDDLCD = 3.3 V, one 100 nF per 2-3 supply pins.\nBacklight: U11 MIC2288 boost 5 V -> 9.6 V, Iled = 1.24 V / (R122||R123 = 9 ohm) = 138 mA, PWM dimming from SSD1963 PWM pin into EN.\nD114 15 V zener clamps the output if the LED string is open. Touch: GT911 on J11, I2C 400 kHz, INT=IO32, RST shared with LCD_RST."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 20 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "04a04a6c-c14c-47de-9849-a5b153aab3af")
	)
